      "source_revision": "56291a0b9cc466341d5d7a4b71aed8b2c5f412bb",
      "summary": "The foundation subsystem is a FastAPI backend for a multi-tenant hybrid RAG service: a create_app entry point exposing health and evaluation routers, a cached typed Settings boundary, an async SQLAlchemy base, a tenant-scoped DocumentService with filesystem storage, and a linear Alembic chain defining identity, content, retrieval, evaluation/audit, and ingestion-job schema. Migrations push authorization, lifecycle, and immutability invariants into PostgreSQL, while containers, Makefile, and CI provide orchestration.",
      "api_calls_last_update": 5
    },
