      "summary": "This subsystem implements dense-query retrieval for a multi-tenant hybrid RAG backend: an injected embedding provider turns a normalized query into a vector used in a k-NN search against an OpenSearch read alias, and hits are renormalized into the shared RetrievalResult contract reused by lexical retrieval. Configuration derives from Settings, diagnostics are separated into a trace, and the only local entry point is a debug CLI, with orchestration living elsewhere.",
